---
// What Spawnfile is not: no server, no runtime, no chat network.
---
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>A file in your repo, not a control plane.</h2>
    <div class="isnot">
      <div><b>No server to run</b><p>No UI, no database, no tickets. The team is source you review in pull requests.</p></div>
      <div><b>Not a runtime</b><p>It emits config for harnesses you already run, and leaves them untouched.</p></div>
      <div><b>Not a chat network</b><p>Agents talk over <a href="https://moltnet.dev" rel="noopener">Moltnet</a>; Spawnfile declares the rooms and starts them.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
